# The Sahagin's Key (outlands 128; call-only): Hurr's trade at SahaginKeyItems 3 (a GM), past both of his trade arms.
# A level 99 Warrior in Sea Serpent Grotto with a Gold Beastcoin, three Mythril Beastcoins and a Norg Shell,
# SahaginKeyProgress 2 (a GM). Items 3: the Gold Beastcoin and the shell, the mythril coins and the shell: nothing.
char zone=SeaSerpentGrotto pos=307.4,27.768,234.3 job=WAR lvl=99
item GoldBeastcoin
item MythrilBeastcoin x3
item NorgShell
charvar SahaginKeyProgress 2
charvar SahaginKeyItems 3
login
trade Hurr_the_Betrayer GoldBeastcoin x1 NorgShell x1  # Items 3: nothing (the gold arm is Items 2 only)
trade Hurr_the_Betrayer MythrilBeastcoin x3 NorgShell x1  # Items 3: nothing (the mythril arm is Items 1 only)
